        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c160ed3e-4bb4-4fc3-b417-dc1e9f426b8e\",\"review_text\":\"App is great. I love the connectivity between phone & pc. Very few times am I unable to find a song. I am literally only writing this to tell spotify to remove the new \\\"smart\\\" shuffle feature. Not only does it exclusively play versions of songs I already have liked, but it will randomly shuffle my Playlist even if shuffle isn't on at all. I have to press shuffle multiple times to turn it off, which is a problem when I'm trying to do it quickly (i.e before a song change or driving.) Stop.\"},{\"review_id\":\"746fe698-13e3-41ac-98ad-6c7a548dfff9\",\"review_text\":\"y mks i love spotify kalo promo\"},{\"review_id\":\"1953c5da-6fb4-45e1-8813-8015fa942b37\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent!!!!!!!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"f68a1328-b948-4848-8430-952d5e2cae73\",\"review_text\":\"REMOVE THE ANNOYING ADS REMOVE IT\"},{\"review_id\":\"0be7b8df-9bfe-4923-8b1a-676f43bac19e\",\"review_text\":\"New update sucks.. uninstalling this app and switching back to jio saavan\"},{\"review_id\":\"cae9e1aa-51aa-45bc-8c45-b362d2b902fa\",\"review_text\":\"It was good until the recent update. I showed u can't play, choose, replay the song you wanna play. If u want to you need Spotify Premium. This is really disappointing. I won't rate 5 stars until you fix this problem.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5a78a8de-6954-46cd-bbee-86bd3b359811\",\"review_text\":\"It's very useful and easy to use\"},{\"review_id\":\"499c6308-3c90-49be-93e2-9a7f49af4e4a\",\"review_text\":\"This is the best music app that I've ever used in my life (and it'll be the best for the rest of it)\"},{\"review_id\":\"e2f812f2-01c7-4a4e-a8a1-22b67a08e6a3\",\"review_text\":\"Worts app ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"55123d02-711d-4e41-b644-06e2c3c4db18\",\"review_text\":\"Whenever I close the app it always logs me out and it did it this time and I had 1300 liked songs and lost all of them\"}]}"
